 Archive (Alternative - Current Method)</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eaddd178-84fb-4557-aef0-a463573fc4cc">
<p local-id=3D"14624b81-341d-4cee-98e6-de55cdb84c8f"><a href=3D"#-part-6-no=
tarization">Part 6: Notarization</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fced0d82-8462-4889-8655-c30d5d64ca91">
<p local-id=3D"4a6d8abf-f98a-4db6-943b-162e10beb9b2"><a href=3D"#-part-7-st=
apling-every-build---dmg-only">Part 7: Stapling (=F0=9F=94=84 EVERY BUILD -=
 DMG ONLY)</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"52ce103d-11ca-4569-987e-847ebdcbe549">
<p local-id=3D"f4aaf013-d011-4d17-a711-fe79ac374f66"><a href=3D"#-part-8-te=
