<p local-id=3D"228a1c3d-dce6-4ea7-bb98-c235a14423cc"><a href=3D"#questions-=
to-verify-your-setup">Questions to Verify Your Setup</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7eccc435-2591-4196-a063-07a06417b78a">
<p local-id=3D"4af535bc-19d1-4c72-9e01-6003f65750a4"><a href=3D"#%EF%B8%8F-=
security-checklist-for-git-repository">Security Checklist for Git Repositor=
y</a></p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"ece1ea9f-8cc8-48f9-b424-23441ca79b9f">
<h2 local-id=3D"e170d05b-8f20-4b5b-b9e7-a20a59834e24" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=93=9AOverview">=F0=9F=93=9A Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"266df857-c934-4f89-bb30-be199e458b7c">This guide will walk y=
ou through the process of signing and notarizing your macOS binary so users=
 can run it without security warnings. You'll learn the "why" behind each s=
tep and execute the commands manually to understand the process.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"3f608656-72b4-4687-af30-9ff52bf90158">
<h2 local-id=3D"1c1ea964-b010-4f77-8ab7-90ae0bf0153d" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8FCriticalNotesforPyInstallerUsers">=E2=
=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Critical Notes for PyInstaller Users</h2>
<p local-id=3D"48541e0c-3aac-40d3-80ff-e179dbd5f9d2"><strong>If you're sign=
ing a PyInstaller binary (like bzm-mcp), READ THIS FIRST:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"36992b09-def4-4f5c-a3bf-336ba701e002">
<li local-id=3D"bfb7027a-2d3c-449a-be81-92accb1df2e4">
<p local-id=3D"75a7e8ae-b06c-46b2-9b7e-487a467f54e1"><strong>You MUST use e=
ntitlements</strong> - Without them, your app will fail with "Team ID misma=
tch" errors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ecc2283-0419-4c59-8c5a-e4ee63948178">
<p local-id=3D"c0920a12-cfa4-4eb4-ad00-2e0bfd4d3f3e"><strong>Raw binaries c=
annot be stapled</strong> - Only .dmg, .app, or .pkg files support stapling=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3720f8e4-e2a0-4423-95c2-76dcee722f36">
<p local-id=3D"dcea168e-b42a-4d66-b742-6e5a6352d28f"><strong>Remove adhoc s=
ignatures first</strong> - PyInstaller adds self-signatures that must be re=
moved</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c4a427f-34b8-4627-a6b0-39a791dec5b5">
<p local-id=3D"dc1a5d92-f22b-44b6-8952-c33e3281feb8"><strong>Test locally b=
efore packaging</strong> - Make sure the signed binary runs before creating=
 the package</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5924b0a3-9d12-4bab-aebd-88c2cc7d4c90">
<p local-id=3D"ce203254-c30b-44aa-8dfb-7a84a5e7ce0f"><strong>ZIP vs DMG</st=
rong> - ZIP files are simpler but cannot be stapled; DMG files support stap=
ling for offline verification</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ba55a0d7-a2e5-401f-b355-3f00f895da5f"><strong>The correct or=
der (ZIP - Current Method):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Build =
=E2=86=92 Remove adhoc signature =E2=86=92 Sign with entitlements =E2=86=92=
 Test locally =E2=86=92=20
Create ZIP =E2=86=92 Notarize ZIP =E2=86=92 Test extracted binary</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"b7457e5f-eb0c-45fc-ae40-715cdca78fa9"><strong>The correct or=
der (DMG - Alternative Method):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Build =
=E2=86=92 Remove adhoc signature =E2=86=92 Sign with entitlements =E2=86=92=
 Test locally =E2=86=92=20
Create DMG =E2=86=92 Sign DMG =E2=86=92 Notarize DMG =E2=86=92 Staple DMG =
=E2=86=92 Test extracted binary</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"e8b8ada8-edd5-4778-8b71-d9ee0ff80561"><strong>Common mistake=
s to avoid:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a1b436a1-23ec-4c65-b0b9-4bb6f7900fd1">
<li local-id=3D"87ef6555-dbff-414c-b0fb-6e48d2e1b4f0">
<p local-id=3D"948f3751-2616-4cee-9283-90d1d5a6ee66">=E2=9D=8C Signing with=
out entitlements (causes runtime errors)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b587392a-21ca-4c17-9110-9a8ee7d73f3a">
<p local-id=3D"345e0440-dc57-46c0-88fb-7f8e8f920463">=E2=9D=8C Creating pac=
kage before signing the binary (users get "malware" warnings)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"54dd8f47-f5f8-4f8c-b98b-bc97c66e8509">
<p local-id=3D"90a94552-c12e-458c-ba2c-c7b7ecdb2333">=E2=9D=8C Trying to st=
aple ZIP files or raw binaries (not supported)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21a5c7b3-7df5-4673-84b1-d5961381b140">
<p local-id=3D"deebedb5-f076-4bd9-9fcf-6069cf0ff69e">=E2=9D=8C Forgetting t=
o test the extracted binary from the package</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"ea15e79a-0b24-45e3-b4c4-7cebdfe7d1e0">
<h2 local-id=3D"c79ff3a1-e1e7-4f5f-906a-5cc4ef6cfef8" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=8E=AFWhatYou'reTryingtoAchieve">=F0=9F=8E=AF Wha=
t You're Trying to Achieve</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9ff61b03-e132-4504-bab1-7a9ffc541905"><strong>The Problem:</=
strong> When users download and try to run your unsigned macOS binary, they=
 get a scary warning: <em>"cannot be opened because the developer cannot be=
 verified"</em> and have to jump through hoops in System Settings to run it=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"642d56e0-1244-44d0-8ade-da9f8e8f89c9"><strong>The Solution:<=
/strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1e288084-a43e-41c2-aa63-b03ceb0b39c6">
<li local-id=3D"55c74d02-e394-4ab9-b4b9-af07e225c248">
<p local-id=3D"db30bec9-0a25-4dc7-a2d2-de85c19b065a"><strong>Code Signing</=
strong> - Cryptographically prove that you created this binary</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1440d44e-4ce7-48ac-92e1-da985b0a30d0">
<p local-id=3D"c9820cd5-2952-48f5-9c92-90f23d5d1938"><strong>Notarization</=
strong> - Have Apple verify your binary doesn't contain malware</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7bfbc41d-4530-4611-ba83-51994d9c10e0">
<p local-id=3D"f45d0d86-5c8c-4de7-b467-8784cd23e583"><strong>Distribution</=
strong> - Package for delivery (ZIP or DMG)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac3c4f36-c892-4e4e-b9f3-6fd1ab54ba17">
<p local-id=3D"fc23e24e-ddb3-44c7-8357-e08eacfdc6e9"><strong>Stapling</stro=
ng> (DMG only) - Attach Apple's approval ticket so it works offline</p></li=
>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"f4bc26ed-e134-4223-848f-016ae7f8d6e1">
<h2 local-id=3D"d27512fe-9cac-452e-8613-0b733899226f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=93=A6ZIPvsDMGDistribution">=F0=9F=93=A6 ZIP vs D=
MG Distribution</h2>
<p local-id=3D"998b9f1e-f9c6-4070-92cf-7c51d063c528"><strong>This guide cov=
ers TWO distribution methods:</strong></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"aebc0f19-ba88-44a2-9f94-bdd0c7b27458" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-ZIPDistribution(CurrentMethod-Simpler)">ZIP Distributio=
n (Current Method - Simpler)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"74c48c11-0b28-40b5-a82d-fc5395787c4d"><strong>Workflow:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Sign Bi=
nary =E2=86=92 Create ZIP =E2=86=92 Notarize ZIP =E2=86=92 Distribute</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"0c8b2433-3f5b-46e5-9534-d887f0c1174c"><strong>Pros:</strong>=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a79196dc-28da-403e-9318-25b657cb8133">
<li local-id=3D"d473419b-a34c-44e9-81cf-21379bb618fa">
<p local-id=3D"b489036b-6e0f-4e2f-8da0-c2a01602115f">=E2=9C=85 Simpler proc=
ess (fewer steps)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"94804447-b630-41fd-8a64-9e9e1f1033d0">
<p local-id=3D"9e1deb22-aa22-4845-bd2f-4fb775c6dce2">=E2=9C=85 No need to s=
ign the archive itself</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38e63ae6-72ed-46cf-b52d-bd167e415a90">
<p local-id=3D"8d022b19-4971-4b60-a756-f32f2525fa04">=E2=9C=85 Faster to cr=
eate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"060417af-d54b-461d-9fd8-8893f149ea07">
<p local-id=3D"3eb2e85c-dfe0-4a9b-b139-2a29c6d5ae31">=E2=9C=85 Standard for=
mat, universally supported</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"090b7281-9a7c-4bdc-bbda-df8a5350530a"><strong>Cons:</strong>=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2206b5b1-ad62-48d9-9bc4-177e740aa98d">
<li local-id=3D"aef33e76-356d-48e6-bd7a-12e48939fdc4">
<p local-id=3D"6ec0a689-fa70-4480-ae76-1e833b8fda9d">=E2=9D=8C Cannot be st=
apled (stapling not supported for ZIP)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c39412a4-50c9-40f4-918f-b1a068c71dc1">
<p local-id=3D"abf0e051-7ae6-428c-a49a-6f3b91ad70da">=E2=9D=8C Requires int=
ernet connection on first run for verification</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2bd4c6a1-6327-4efd-a09e-b60b6249c89c">
<p local-id=3D"bf5ac38f-1fbf-498c-9637-38be000861b9">=E2=9D=8C Less polishe=
d user experience</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b1d87670-6b92-4979-bd33-a31eac95a60e"><strong>Best for:</str=
ong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c5fb4672-b889-4af9-a05d-ffebbd3454a9">
<li local-id=3D"72a06e17-e0e0-4c6a-976b-2d312df9e49d">
<p local-id=3D"c16b08b7-eccc-4016-9a72-06632ecf4e63">Command-line tools</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"5490c8c3-1185-4533-8c73-c8a20b10f763">
<p local-id=3D"ab41a00f-3425-4f6c-9adb-90acf6ce47b9">Developer-focused tool=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ea21e5a-eeb5-4628-8e94-826226208f02">
<p local-id=3D"92a3e000-03e6-4931-91cc-0f98011713be">Internal distribution<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ea08f2e5-5580-46ee-9ff7-608dea2551de">
<p local-id=3D"eb0bc353-aee9-4d2d-a41c-9e72c40df40d">When simplicity is pri=
oritized</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"d16b8258-e0aa-4956-8c4a-f3dc2d8a9e71" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-DMGDistribution(AlternativeMethod-MorePolished)">DMG Di=
stribution (Alternative Method - More Polished)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a8b3492f-55c1-4c11-aca4-b7a0af9ffb6e"><strong>Workflow:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Sign Bi=
nary =E2=86=92 Create DMG =E2=86=92 Sign DMG =E2=86=92 Notarize DMG =E2=86=
=92 Staple DMG =E2=86=92 Distribute</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"1b431612-645d-40b8-a7be-cc8b5ff4a17b"><strong>Pros:</strong>=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2359f438-bee6-43a2-ac9c-618f0d5ad703">
<li local-id=3D"054ab9eb-7ed5-4bb8-8c1f-c243c7a04978">
<p local-id=3D"b38a76fd-afe6-412c-80c9-d05d03dacd19">=E2=9C=85 Can be stapl=
ed (works offline after notarization)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f8454bb-8408-4d2f-98cc-c8b63324dbfb">
<p local-id=3D"a9f258ad-f9f9-435c-9a4a-b0201da7d362">=E2=9C=85 Professional=
 installer experience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88fa969e-c6d8-4fbe-8e49-57ee7b185465">
<p local-id=3D"f825d0d2-aaa8-4c1a-b3c6-5099de46495f">=E2=9C=85 Can include =
custom backgrounds, licenses</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7fa7ccfc-3939-4107-9cd6-90689501f3d7">
<p local-id=3D"2eb8edcb-f35d-4e32-af08-cead7dcb84ef">=E2=9C=85 Traditional =
macOS distribution format</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"092b9ef8-4842-41d0-94ad-35eb2ee20146"><strong>Cons:</strong>=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"88049ab5-c78a-40fd-82fa-a5e608839d48">
<li local-id=3D"f0e0981c-2e41-41c9-99f8-fa60ea30bf64">
<p local-id=3D"43ee9b5f-fa51-4862-99fd-523364a51ae2">=E2=9D=8C More complex=
 (additional signing and stapling steps)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c3f08b6a-1a27-47be-b1a9-c1e4fa290935">
<p local-id=3D"ee25fa63-9c50-481c-9c97-5d9111c1c8bb">=E2=9D=8C Requires sig=
ning both binary AND DMG</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"98bbd2c8-f5f7-4045-8d86-d3c359bfbdc6">
<p local-id=3D"62e0f610-2a7c-4ae7-a28f-9f96cde6024f">=E2=9D=8C Takes longer=
 to create</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f6664069-2899-4d6d-8b28-1b6aae7d5a3e"><strong>Best for:</str=
ong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d000a9a5-59bc-43bc-9bd5-e02672bb744b">
<li local-id=3D"08f0126e-db74-4be5-91e7-294e71c3a3a9">
<p local-id=3D"7bdf7507-5540-4585-9db4-32b67b9e4aa9">End-user applications<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88314a93-fe17-4f5d-aa4e-d08c1278fb6c">
<p local-id=3D"a1dcd11b-3b22-4d2d-85c3-bb4d173fe275">Professional software =
distribution</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3525a685-6984-4525-bb89-9dd98445d91b">
<p local-id=3D"7be18d88-e5f9-44e7-bc83-0adc66eccf35">When offline verificat=
ion is important</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aa34abf8-0031-44d8-ab2c-8ba113e6cea6">
<p local-id=3D"ee2ea4ae-82f2-4778-8d29-16458ed7e095">When polished UX matte=
rs</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"384aa5d4-4d64-4bad-880e-f3758d185d1b"><strong>Key Difference=
 - Stapling:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"6f3ae444-6600-48db-bf9f-73981bc58150">
<li local-id=3D"a8620797-f1df-4abb-9a16-71e265e6df78">
<p local-id=3D"c15d0fbb-5ba3-44d6-b6be-7a1635f0044c"><strong>ZIP:</strong> =
Cannot be stapled. macOS checks Apple's servers on first run (requires inte=
rnet)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fc2f1233-35c6-443b-8ea2-177b12df867a">
<p local-id=3D"9b53bf51-8905-4b3f-abb9-5d9236974ce3"><strong>DMG:</strong> =
Can be stapled. Notarization ticket embedded in file (works offline)</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"15a267fe-43d4-475a-a5e6-65846cebd692">Both methods are secur=
e and Apple-approved. Choose based on your use case!</p>
<hr local-id=3D"be3dad13-b87c-4c67-8f07-3460a4cd5310">
<h2 local-id=3D"e0eda152-32b2-44a3-b73a-0c14476054fc" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=94=91Prerequisites">=F0=9F=94=91 Prerequisites</=
h2>
<p local-id=3D"b4918bf4-c51b-4608-b5e5-deea3a7ac2c3">You mentioned you have=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"669fc5b2-8e63-46ec-9428-a62be3514bdd">
<li local-id=3D"0c6659f1-9750-457c-9e1c-8936c6eb46e7">
<p local-id=3D"841114da-4d75-40fa-a812-bb21eb06e57e"><strong>Apple Issuer U=
UID</strong> (from App Store Connect API)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"392afd10-eeff-4a63-b32a-c14e5029995c">
<p local-id=3D"0fc7428f-a46b-48a9-a146-b99c2c8b1996"><strong>Apple User ID<=
/strong> (your Apple Developer account email)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f1f0c58-09db-435b-90ac-db13830a2e98">
<p local-id=3D"e50e69fb-1616-4d39-9cc1-20ee6f5f5ce2"><strong>macOS Auth Key=
 file</strong> (<code>.p8</code> file for API authentication)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f8e917fd-094e-406d-bb33-dfc2d09617c4">
<p local-id=3D"06fcea61-03ef-449e-aff4-fba193df5e76"><strong>Certificate zi=
p</strong> (Developer ID Application certificate)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"1c516242-be51-478f-ba71-5d04b7b6d058">
<h2 local-id=3D"a3d23956-5fc9-4c13-96a6-aacfeab8d5fe" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=94=92SecurityBestPractices">=F0=9F=94=92 Securit=
y Best Practices</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6f6cef90-5c70-4769-b65a-bf407da11ab7"><strong>IMPORTANT:</st=
rong> Code signing credentials are sensitive! Follow these security guideli=
nes:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"3798b8ff-685b-4c02-a699-b0c0f6f181c8" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=E2=9C=85Do's:">=E2=9C=85 Do's:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"f539c56d-abb5-4573-ad57-b4fc87b0460e">
<li local-id=3D"315a184a-0510-47ca-b099-2ab8e0986e70">
<p local-id=3D"426ecc51-fb71-4bf8-95a0-1ceb50704aa2"><strong>Use secure tem=
porary directories</strong> with restricted permissions (<code>chmod 700</c=
ode>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec36847c-36dc-44c4-af6c-1c68121af699">
<p local-id=3D"848b3f5f-bd33-410f-a159-6cc2da8015b6"><strong>Import certifi=
cates to Keychain immediately</strong> after extraction</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ced88b5-73bb-490e-93cc-143c889d604f">
<p local-id=3D"01f66ed1-d825-4123-9a98-ed5c8c93386e"><strong>Delete extract=
ed files</strong> as soon as they're imported</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eeed5fec-1ce7-4dd9-b097-e19827666b3c">
<p local-id=3D"53340894-1b3b-4529-83d1-915d95a68c05"><strong>Store API keys=
 in </strong><code>~/.apple-keys</code> with restricted permissions (<code>=
chmod 600</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1b29ab73-27fa-4951-8137-83473b9e380b">
<p local-id=3D"00e8ca44-b2a6-4139-9fa9-5b8d7ea2c03d"><strong>Use Keychain t=
o store notarization credentials</strong> (via <code>notarytool store-crede=
ntials</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f1a38a4c-0d9c-4ca7-a71e-e814f5d2c519">
<p local-id=3D"53847717-adf5-4364-80c9-2ee919c996ee"><strong>Keep backups</=
strong> of credentials in a secure password manager or vault</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9c8fc915-9e22-403c-87a2-ea37fd795dcb" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=E2=9D=8CDon'ts:">=E2=9D=8C Don'ts:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c0afcc5c-9dac-4f45-ae86-533e5640094e">
<li local-id=3D"89a0710b-579d-4ae2-9ff5-db8cec8f40d0">
<p local-id=3D"3f979f44-2449-4968-ac39-201c5ffb3629">=E2=9D=8C Leave certif=
icate files in Downloads folder</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e909a57-cc8e-4c09-a1b9-dbe576110317">
<p local-id=3D"1fdf4dcd-c61f-46af-8cb0-f6bbd5f2383d">=E2=9D=8C Commit <code=
>.p8</code> files or certificates to git (add to <code>.gitignore</code>)</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b8b4266-53c0-482a-9f87-c08a4e4f96ce">
<p local-id=3D"45442274-057a-4a32-a685-f6c30f2246b0">=E2=9D=8C Store creden=
tials in cloud-synced folders (Dropbox, iCloud Drive)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1736e34b-9190-45e5-a27b-740d25588060">
<p local-id=3D"4fb72cfb-a22c-419e-b568-8484525058c6">=E2=9D=8C Email creden=
tials unencrypted</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f83e0dab-e5e9-4a45-a006-5e1db842638f">
<p local-id=3D"c92b638f-3f4f-4465-b84d-0b65f89f11f5">=E2=9D=8C Share your K=
eychain password</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"75524829-be13-469e-aaef-e369591f2d85">
<p local-id=3D"c61857b8-7519-4858-9e6d-c03b27ffb932">=E2=9D=8C Leave creden=
tials in temporary directories after import</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9cb160ad-1b46-417d-a670-4e56db02874c" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=8E=AFWhatGetsStoredWhere:">=F0=9F=8E=AF What Get=
s Stored Where:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2b7d77b9-8133-4e0e-b114-0806c5b026e1">
<li local-id=3D"82120a06-2348-4eff-bd88-b0e2e15607dc">
<p local-id=3D"8b324fd6-5225-409a-9b4e-8a94cf2f9850"><strong>Certificates &=
amp; Private Keys</strong> =E2=86=92 Keychain (secure, encrypted by macOS)<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"323e9665-5cfa-4199-b4b2-caa09d99a3e5">
<p local-id=3D"f2950d15-b7bf-4e30-9961-16d7c3ad93f1"><strong>API Key (.p8 f=
ile)</strong> =E2=86=92 <code>~/.apple-keys/</code> (needed for future sign=
ing)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"96a2723c-3f51-4039-8aa2-233ac86caff0">
<p local-id=3D"f0c46d2c-db7d-49a5-be78-32e605a0a4b0"><strong>Notarization c=
redentials</strong> =E2=86=92 Keychain (via notarytool profile)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8959b0ed-c274-4e04-879f-32a978fbb0f0">
<p local-id=3D"9782e3e4-fa0b-4702-a304-790721e4e59a"><strong>Original files=
</strong> =E2=86=92 Delete after import (or store in secure vault only)</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"e6264af3-f443-44bd-8962-80b9332ff636">
<h2 local-id=3D"de9ca501-25b3-43c3-8557-5d68b2f826c6" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=93=96Part1:UnderstandingtheCredentials">=F0=9F=
=93=96 Part 1: Understanding the Credentials</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"ee54e4ee-d540-402f-956b-b5b11ae71dbc" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-1.1TheCertificate(DeveloperIDApplication)">1.1 The Cert=
ificate (Developer ID Application)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"51245562-3f3d-4a4d-b18c-30393c41fb0b"><strong>What it is:</s=
trong> A cryptographic certificate that proves you're a registered Apple de=
veloper. Think of it like a digital passport.</p>
<p local-id=3D"46b10c46-5171-4a8e-9d56-8e4ad17e6e26"><strong>Where it comes=
 from:</strong> Apple Developer Program ($99/year membership)</p>
<p local-id=3D"01ee5524-23b5-42c8-95b6-3ebc2d5dda7b"><strong>Two parts:</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"81a75dc4-5f8d-403a-8355-b0ed0fe951f1">
<li local-id=3D"0576cafc-0ad7-42a9-9d48-2b0ab34500fa">
<p local-id=3D"5cb3aa99-079b-4247-9a34-0fb974cf16fe"><strong>Certificate (.=
cer file)</strong> - The public part</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6623eccc-d54c-46ea-886f-c00e00a6af1e">
<p local-id=3D"43d21823-ede1-4b09-9468-800bade47a7a"><strong>Private key (.=
p12 or in Keychain)</strong> - The secret part that does the signing</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c57a3668-9569-4030-b9ff-03120762f84c" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-1.2TheAPIKey(forNotarization)">1.2 The API Key (for Not=
arization)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"55e6af0f-6be0-4226-8490-c3b636eb2197"><strong>What it is:</s=
trong> A token that lets tools communicate with Apple's notarization servic=
e without typing your password.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7677f7ef-f5f2-4c19-b80f-135ea9cc3c0d"><strong>The three piec=
es:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e6739719-9b8e-4dcb-8987-547982b8438b">
<li local-id=3D"66df7f60-187d-4e00-b1cb-c94d18bf8247">
<p local-id=3D"9a481c02-4f27-4a80-937a-637de1079d63"><strong>AuthKey_XXXXXX=
XXXX.p8</strong> - The key file itself</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1b5e90b3-b7f1-4b6c-9a3c-c7d6f949a77e">
<p local-id=3D"c86b10d4-acea-4f94-a9c9-2847a75462f3"><strong>Key ID</strong=
> - The XXXXXXXXXX part of the filename</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"77b91f4d-22df-4bfc-94ee-53275d048409">
<p local-id=3D"98eb3546-6c52-4b47-b74e-ce43855684a8"><strong>Issuer ID</str=
ong> - Your team's UUID from App Store Connect</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"d4d6b096-aed1-45c9-87ec-45508f3aa04c">
<h2 local-id=3D"ee1c9507-be7d-4acc-b5c3-e71e89b87a69" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8FPart2:SettingUpYourEnvironment(=E2=
=8F=B0ONE-TIMESETUP)">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F Part 2: Setting Up Your Environ=
ment (=E2=8F=B0 ONE-TIME SETUP)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"f841a817-6aac-40ee-92fa-83a7bc5de970" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Step1:InstallXcodeCommandLineTools">Step 1: Install Xco=
de Command Line Tools</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">xcode-s=
elect --install</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"fb5d78ff-2a00-4178-b296-9c1ff88bf4e0"><strong>Why:</strong> =
Provides <code>codesign</code>, <code>productsign</code>, <code>notarytool<=
/code>, and other essential tools.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f4fe7ae8-afa5-435c-85ff-e41aec98b691"><strong>Verify install=
ation:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">codesig=
n --version</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"db82566d-3fe3-4342-8d20-85750cdf8e11" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Step2:ExtractandInstallYourCertificate">Step 2: Extract=
 and Install Your Certificate</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d18a6387-8a5c-439b-bea8-b694c696bc52"><strong>Create a secur=
e temporary directory:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Creat=
e a secure temp directory (only you can access)
mkdir -p ~/tmp/signing-setup
chmod 700 ~/tmp/signing-setup
cd ~/tmp/signing-setup</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f472ffe9-0a48-45a6-935f-efe54bcc1279"><strong>Move/download =
your certificates here, then extract:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># If ce=
rtificates.zip is in Downloads, move it here
mv ~/Downloads/certificates.zip .

# Extract the certificates
unzip certificates.zip
ls -la</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"c32083d9-e8a2-48fd-a31a-98a609b91c65"><strong>Understanding =
what you have:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"77b90061-93f2-4ac8-a044-d628704aecba">Based on your extracti=
on, you should see these files:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Apple-D=
eveloper-ID-Certification-Authority.cer    =E2=86=90 Apple's root certifica=
te
password.txt                                       =E2=86=90 Password for .=
p12 files
Apple-Developer-ID-Application-2025.p12           =E2=86=90 =E2=AD=90 MAIN =
FILE (cert + key)
Apple-Developer-ID-Application-2025.cer           =E2=86=90 Just the certif=
icate
Apple-Developer-ID-Application-2025.pem           =E2=86=90 PEM format (opt=
ional)
Apple-Developer-ID-Installer-2025.p12             =E2=86=90 For .pkg instal=
lers (not needed)
Apple-Developer-ID-Installer-2025.cer             =E2=86=90 For .pkg instal=
lers (not needed)
... (other files)</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8ccbcb56-9d2d-4d4a-8168-363914d76759"><strong>=F0=9F=8E=AF K=
ey Files Explained:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"97=
4bec27-9be8-4126-8fbf-745fa7f64540" class=3D"confluenceTable">
