<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Process=
ing: /path/to/bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg
Processing: /path/to/bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg
The staple and validate action worked!</pre>
