</div>
<p local-id=3D"3ccdc226-100b-4813-a0eb-bd77e8d9d101"><strong>What happened:=
</strong> The notarization ticket is now embedded in the DMG file. Users ca=
n verify it offline!</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8fb305e5-5572-4e51-b7f3-954ba17a1547">
<h2 local-id=3D"a3bcad79-2334-4b02-be3e-33578083ce11" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=8E=89Part8:Testing(=F0=9F=94=84EVERYBUILD)">=F0=
=9F=8E=89 Part 8: Testing (=F0=9F=94=84 EVERY BUILD)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"0edbf887-c6b9-48cc-9fc5-4d4f826a7a61" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Step20:TestYourSigned&amp;NotarizedPackage">Step 20: Te=
st Your Signed &amp; Notarized Package</h3>
<p local-id=3D"70c7a5e2-c9c8-4b36-9823-eeb8621f6c6a"><strong>For ZIP files =
(Current Method):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Check=
 notarization status
spctl --assess --verbose=3D4 --type install bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.zip</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a1dfada6-ed35-4710-8408-0a5379ce8e93"><strong>For DMG files =
(Alternative Method):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Verif=
y signature
codesign --verify --deep --strict --verbose=3D2 bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg

# Check notarization and stapling
spctl --assess --verbose=3D4 --type open --context context:primary-signatur=
e bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"49b64e67-3880-469a-afe1-f02f2cf12291"><strong>What you want =
to see:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">bzm-mcp=
-macos-arm64.zip: accepted
source=3DNotarized Developer ID</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"ddd48f4d-138c-42b7-a338-220696e063d7">or</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">bzm-mcp=
-macos-arm64.dmg: accepted
source=3DNotarized Developer ID</pre>
</div>
</div>
