-Notarization-Stamp-Step21:TheReal-WorldTest">Step 21: The Real-World Test<=
/h3>
<p local-id=3D"b0435cad-cede-4ba9-96bb-f2f1e7cc89e7"><strong>For ZIP files:=
</strong></p>
