: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">cd ~/De=
sktop
unzip /Users/joaquinaraujo/github/bzm-mcp/dist/bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.zip</pre=
>
</div>
</div></li>
