<li local-id=3D"ebf7af37-afc7-442f-a730-947937a94152">
<p local-id=3D"8965be7c-ccf2-4abd-8e92-080bd627eed1"><strong>Verify the bin=
ary inside the DMG is properly signed:</strong></p>
