<li local-id=3D"301f0860-607a-49e9-9596-ec106bf207d9">
<p local-id=3D"2c1f245b-f2c2-4325-b102-37e0dcbfcd9a"><strong>Extract the bi=
nary to Desktop:</strong></p>
