umes/BlazeMeter\ MCP/bzm-mcp-macos-arm64 ~/Desktop/</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
<li local-id=3D"b7591f95-f8de-4c79-8bfb-ccbb7d142fa4">
<p local-id=3D"916953b8-0897-4cd2-834c-a48be53f7527"><strong>Run the extrac=
