<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">~/Deskt=
op/bzm-mcp-macos-arm64 --version</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
<li local-id=3D"a43aaa2d-768a-4da0-b7aa-2d0327dffaa9">
<p local-id=3D"da4a2b99-52d8-417e-9c34-ef15fa53735d"><strong>Unmount the DM=
G:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
