 detach /Volumes/BlazeMeter\ MCP</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"cb7dbe3d-c0db-4bff-8c08-c7b1ec878a61"><strong>What should ha=
ppen (both ZIP and DMG):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"01f6fbc7-aa8b-43ee-89d6-8d820edeaf8a">
<li local-id=3D"11ec0305-9834-4b4b-a623-b939c02fdfb4">
<p local-id=3D"554624a3-4086-4c96-8611-ea77dadeeec1">=E2=9C=85 Binary extra=
cts successfully</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"95d342cc-62c4-4123-bd32-d5b71505ada5">
<p local-id=3D"3538ead1-bf65-4a8a-8e5e-98602c93dab9">=E2=9C=85 Binary runs =
without warnings</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30fd4cdf-d4f8-49c4-9c7f-4cd479cfa809">
<p local-id=3D"aae5adf2-7b19-4ac4-8bbc-e0ba8abef40a">=E2=9C=85 No "malware"=
 errors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bacbbbe4-1d75-4652-886e-803d5d001287">
<p local-id=3D"0afe34f0-a737-4bff-9d81-c729a2f4dc7b">=E2=9C=85 No Team ID m=
ismatch errors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4d54cadb-fc17-4d4f-844d-766756152d7b">
<p local-id=3D"3a61bce6-7c3d-4713-9bcd-3bde5c580385">=E2=9C=85 Application =
works as expected</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d5d4b794-61fb-4ac0-8bf3-e257ca96a7cd"><strong>If you see err=
ors:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"1bf5d3b0-de5c-4127-a62a-5f375db17d9d">
<li local-id=3D"1786b0a8-c2b3-4a34-b6c5-bc47a9902a35">
<p local-id=3D"5becf50d-e7e8-4f29-88a9-dbd7a6d264a4">"Apple cannot verify" =
=E2=86=92 Notarization didn't work, check logs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e39030ca-d822-497d-b450-143970473325">
<p local-id=3D"57d884ab-ee4c-4518-b00f-66b724342595">"Team ID mismatch" =E2=
=86=92 Entitlements not applied correctly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26173bfc-f334-46b9-8dff-bcd090a39276">
<p local-id=3D"0dddfab0-cd55-4e70-b404-8a8b26183f61">"Damaged" =E2=86=92 Si=
gnature issue, re-sign with <code>--force</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3882bdbf-8c7b-41b9-a3bb-dc1796496ed7">
<p local-id=3D"d855a11b-d623-4216-b83a-9c5a1ac28c58">"Network required" (ZI=
P only) =E2=86=92 Expected on first run, normal behavior</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c0cdbe66-0699-4a91-8e90-6c7922059b8c" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Step22:TheUltimateTest">Step 22: The Ultimate Test</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f0c9786f-0bab-42b0-b38a-f2b0ea2129b7"><strong>Send it to som=
eone else (or test on a different Mac):</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c855e285-630d-4a21-a912-4c86e7404f95">This is the final proo=
f that everything works:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"410e93ab-b6f8-461f-8c76-c1977e39de30">
<li local-id=3D"c28b083d-7d7e-410e-8390-ce9049ca7c0a">
<p local-id=3D"3843f0dd-0c16-4b5c-a1bc-fec00113da0b">Upload the DMG to clou=
d storage or your website</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"191908c6-106e-4f8f-b752-51f6629a25d5">
<p local-id=3D"89f93f8c-8555-4ff2-bca1-8d3d68b1b338">Download it on a <stro=
ng>different Mac</strong> (not the one you built on)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88f59574-e9b4-4591-87aa-e171e8ee8922">
<p local-id=3D"16832c92-2ccc-439e-80db-2972e63d9144">Double-click to mount =
the DMG</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1af83679-3349-4d75-aa18-f59cc99f5b64">
<p local-id=3D"39118280-b7ce-4d73-bda9-b29fea8a6896">Drag the binary to Des=
ktop</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a4420fbd-f83b-43d8-93f6-4d6faac9399e">
<p local-id=3D"5fda42f3-82a8-4249-97a8-bba6be98d379">Double-click to run (o=
r run from terminal)</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"6ff9c286-b78e-4b75-bb25-bbaee9056f51"><strong>It should run =
without ANY warnings!</strong> =F0=9F=8E=8A</p>
<p local-id=3D"a4ac5853-c1e7-4715-81c6-c9c523cc2ad1"><strong>Why test on a =
different Mac?</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d131f464-1e21-4e86-8737-3df442f4ccf5">
<li local-id=3D"0219e703-befa-4e58-8083-2524fea103c4">
<p local-id=3D"9d66e0da-15db-469d-adf6-7821cb87c6a3">Gatekeeper behaves dif=
ferently on the build machine</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8f33fe42-9a46-4780-b858-0761b0dcf17d">
<p local-id=3D"3604c3e9-fbcb-43f3-b7bb-a0c21b17b0b4">Ensures the notarizati=
on ticket is properly embedded</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a8adc4db-52be-4d43-8685-d5daf54b207c">
<p local-id=3D"e5cd93cd-15ec-4229-8bd8-1b677c00c8a2">Confirms users will ha=
ve a smooth experience</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2cf749ea-26c3-4cbe-9be0-c21131ad0ddd">
<h2 local-id=3D"536d6988-ad1b-457c-aa7e-7bd778daf83f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=94=84Part9:TheAMD64(Intel)Binary(=F0=9F=94=84EVE=
RYBUILD)">=F0=9F=94=84 Part 9: The AMD64 (Intel) Binary (=F0=9F=94=84 EVERY=
 BUILD)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"3cea0300-a120-40f6-952a-ea40390c9d70">Repeat the same proces=
s for your Intel Mac binary. <strong>Don't forget the entitlements!</strong=
></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"4acda4b8-1c4f-4a75-abdc-2257ac91800c" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-UsingZIP(CurrentMethod):">Using ZIP (Current Method):</=
h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">cd /Use=
rs/joaquinaraujo/github/bzm-mcp/dist

SIGNING_IDENTITY=3D"Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAM_ID)"

# 1. Check and remove quarantine attribute
xattr -l bzm-mcp-macos-amd64
# If quarantine found, remove it:
xattr -d com.apple.quarantine bzm-mcp-macos-amd64 2&gt;/dev/null || true

# 2. Remove adhoc signature and sign with entitlements
codesign --remove-signature bzm-mcp-macos-amd64
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements ../entitlements.plist \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  bzm-mcp-macos-amd64

# 3. Test locally
./bzm-mcp-macos-amd64 --version

# 4. Create ZIP
ditto -c -k --sequesterRsrc --keepParent bzm-mcp-macos-amd64 bzm-mcp-macos-=
amd64.zip

# 5. Notarize ZIP
xcrun notarytool submit bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.zip \
  --keychain-profile "bzm-mcp-notary" \
  --wait

# 6. Verify
spctl --assess --type install bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.zip</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"146bf2c0-3850-47c1-975b-5e51c51e56d8" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-UsingDMG(AlternativeMethod):">Using DMG (Alternative Me=
thod):</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">cd /Use=
rs/joaquinaraujo/github/bzm-mcp/dist

SIGNING_IDENTITY=3D"Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAM_ID)"

# 1-3. Same as ZIP method above (quarantine, sign, test)

# 4. Create DMG
mkdir -p ~/tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64
cp bzm-mcp-macos-amd64 ~/tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64/
hdiutil create -volname "BlazeMeter MCP Intel" \
  -srcfolder ~/tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64 \
  -ov -format UDZO \
  bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.dmg
rm -rf ~/tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64

# 5. Sign DMG
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.dmg

# 6. Notarize DMG
xcrun notarytool submit bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.dmg \
  --keychain-profile "bzm-mcp-notary" \
  --wait

# 7. Staple DMG
xcrun stapler staple bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.dmg

# 8. Verify
xcrun stapler validate bzm-mcp-macos-amd64.dmg
spctl --assess --type open --context context:primary-signature bzm-mcp-maco=
s-amd64.dmg</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"c07f4c54-0026-4887-b982-5c5a976a387d"><strong>Now you have b=
oth architectures signed and notarized!</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e3964e37-da38-4749-a3df-e38ba6f111f1"><strong>ZIP Distributi=
on (Current):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d8727c02-dbdd-43b0-81d5-f9e33b66d353">
<li local-id=3D"a92f7aaa-fb11-41b7-a969-81ffe9e9f905">
<p local-id=3D"e98b53a4-e713-49d1-8419-98371ec970eb"><code>bzm-mcp-macos-ar=
m64.zip</code> - For Apple Silicon Macs (M1, M2, M3, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d9e34473-feed-481d-b762-aa48a04a4aca">
<p local-id=3D"5fb8ce96-e1b3-4d97-a951-4e6c40b213a8"><code>bzm-mcp-macos-am=
d64.zip</code> - For Intel Macs</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0564da64-df68-4b57-9d15-bfad42bb8d2e"><strong>DMG Distributi=
on (Alternative):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5365dcbe-1410-461c-8a67-6f12cf8dd8d6">
<li local-id=3D"c86208de-7e3d-45ec-b0df-314374a84f16">
<p local-id=3D"8e364cb2-015b-4c37-b1e8-282151eec6dc"><code>bzm-mcp-macos-ar=
m64.dmg</code> - For Apple Silicon Macs (M1, M2, M3, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"68d98f52-28bf-4885-901b-a143295018b8">
<p local-id=3D"c8692340-6ce4-4dfa-8b08-ae1358b4bea9"><code>bzm-mcp-macos-am=
d64.dmg</code> - For Intel Macs</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2fe89d06-97fa-4877-8287-a8df8af72711">
<h2 local-id=3D"f54ce8d6-092d-4a22-9256-c1fd1c10f1d8" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=9A=A8CommonIssues&amp;Solutions">=F0=9F=9A=A8 Co=
mmon Issues &amp; Solutions</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"5032ce62-056d-4bf6-8005-dcf486fa5a12" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue1:&quot;DeveloperIDApplicationcertificatenotfound&=
quot;">Issue 1: "Developer ID Application certificate not found"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b0936929-de7a-4f8e-b6c1-208750ba84d0"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># List =
all signing identities
security find-identity -v -p codesigning

# If empty, your certificate isn't installed
# Re-import your .p12 or .cer file</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"4b683ce3-070f-41bf-9f19-835a19d5bfae" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue2:&quot;Theoperationcouldn'tbecompleted.Unabletofi=
ndsigningcertificate&quot;">Issue 2: "The operation couldn't be completed. =
Unable to find signing certificate"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3a13d666-92c6-4406-bc69-af4c5c2fa29e"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong> Your certificate might be in a different keychain or expired.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Check=
 certificate expiration
security find-certificate -c "Developer ID Application" -p | openssl x509 -=
noout -enddate</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"99e3e7f0-2664-4b50-9f8d-06094700a83b" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue3:Notarizationfailswith&quot;invalidsignature&quot=
;">Issue 3: Notarization fails with "invalid signature"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"88b61ec1-2029-4c70-89aa-3adddcd8f72e"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong> Make sure you:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"879d84ed-b811-4fb8-a20e-f71b685ba8da">
<li local-id=3D"5f9b54c3-5a10-4c54-8965-3703b283010b">
<p local-id=3D"edbd653d-4e6e-4955-87aa-441cafb22483">Signed with <code>--op=
tions runtime</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cad93ae4-005c-42a4-ad7c-8b53d85762d3">
<p local-id=3D"31f8eff1-069d-4f79-bad7-eb07ca7144ff">Included <code>--times=
tamp</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b3b7fec-071b-4d0c-b24d-9657c7c01c11">
<p local-id=3D"ef67ece0-8bd5-40d0-9f85-89bcb0733231">Used a Developer ID ce=
rtificate (not a Mac App Distribution certificate)</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"c7df2f46-ea2e-4884-9387-707d1be1458f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue4:&quot;UnabletocommunicatewithApple'sservers&quot=
;">Issue 4: "Unable to communicate with Apple's servers"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bd5b66a6-d0b3-46c9-8e6d-c487ba65785f"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"36d45b22-bc06-41af-98b0-5dd0c2fe8f3a">
<li local-id=3D"60f503ad-cf66-4945-9170-216ac4d0d8c7">
<p local-id=3D"57378856-f18b-43bb-9c12-40108b2a8fbb">Check your internet co=
nnection</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9582234f-71fe-4929-accd-ef0ac68ba55e">
<p local-id=3D"2ff333c7-e437-475e-ade4-3cbd91424092">Verify your API key ha=
sn't expired</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b69c9a60-ebbc-4010-badd-57dbd3519487">
<p local-id=3D"37696ed7-78fa-43fe-a1cc-cdbf5f1993ea">Check the Key ID and I=
ssuer ID are correct</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"e61ec8d8-22b4-49d9-9fed-688af0c0e83d" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue5:DMGworksonmyMacbutnotothers">Issue 5: DMG works =
on my Mac but not others</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c8c10f0d-6ad1-478a-bb2c-41349ebdd16d"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong> You probably forgot to staple!</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">xcrun s=
tapler staple bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"0746beab-8ef1-4fce-893d-ebd64f6e1b15" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue6:&quot;Applecannotverifythisappisfreefrommalware&=
quot;">Issue 6: "Apple cannot verify this app is free from malware"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"afc1d80c-59af-4507-8b63-37188abccf79"><strong>Causes:</stron=
g></p>
<ul local-id=3D"49e1f805-b2ca-4333-9c8c-3651982eba4d">
<li local-id=3D"ee38d0a3-7968-43db-b5aa-4aab292e29e8">
<p local-id=3D"c48acf81-06f7-4d4c-afa9-9eb8b4df6750">Binary not properly no=
tarized</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8457d3b4-3786-450c-a37d-de7c174ec45a">
<p local-id=3D"9ad209bf-450d-4a68-aeca-de1304ad7de6">Notarization ticket no=
t found</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21c6e1b5-113a-486c-a6bc-e0448d74609e">
<p local-id=3D"f4b545a8-f1dc-4d0f-96d3-d46f150eac41">Binary was signed but =
notarization failed</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0e9a7954-22a8-4b5d-b1de-6a5c425d60cd"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Verif=
y DMG is notarized and stapled
stapler validate bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg

# Check if binary inside DMG is properly signed
hdiutil attach bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.dmg
codesign --display --verbose=3D4 /Volumes/BlazeMeter\ MCP/bzm-mcp-macos-arm=
64
# Should show Authority=3DDeveloper ID Application (NOT Signature=3Dadhoc)

# If adhoc, you put the wrong binary in the DMG - re-sign and recreate</pre=
>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"23e1efbb-a6c8-4798-a573-c4a9c0e880f3" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue7:&quot;Error73&quot;whenstapling">Issue 7: "Error=
 73" when stapling</h3>
<p local-id=3D"6d9c5bd5-7e2f-4b7f-bb93-829aea72e4bc"><strong>Cause:</strong=
> You're trying to staple a raw executable binary.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7d379c3b-b523-434b-8d4f-ec61bd9223a8"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong> You can only staple:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b380fb23-a145-4cc6-9726-ed6283921e19">
<li local-id=3D"25256f6e-7aa9-4606-aee0-71b4a83f97d8">
<p local-id=3D"8207aff4-f8fb-4cfd-bb63-d044e972345f"><code>.app</code> bund=
les</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c008da4-477c-49ae-9ef7-c847e5c1ace6">
<p local-id=3D"74feac60-ca6f-451b-ac82-a967ad89196d"><code>.dmg</code> file=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"97e312af-9d97-47c3-9390-8b9233449b73">
<p local-id=3D"f58389f5-f7f3-4a99-9765-cc02f1a5b200"><code>.pkg</code> inst=
allers</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e295dafe-26ce-46b9-bc57-e160d32c9f5b">For raw binaries, stap=
le the DMG that contains them, not the binary itself.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"5a1385ae-8289-4acc-b649-391e137a142a" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue8:Binaryfailswith&quot;TeamIDmismatch&quot;orPytho=
nloadingerrors">Issue 8: Binary fails with "Team ID mismatch" or Python loa=
ding errors</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a71130ed-3c4f-4777-a062-7635590e3f1f"><strong>Cause:</strong=
> PyInstaller apps need entitlements to load embedded Python framework.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e927fbb6-da39-4776-aea1-4740493dae02"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Make =
sure you signed with entitlements
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements entitlements.plist \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  bzm-mcp-macos-arm64

# Verify entitlements are present
codesign --display --entitlements - bzm-mcp-macos-arm64</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"35a36758-bdd3-4c94-bfc6-f67f84741256" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue9:&quot;isalreadysigned&quot;message">Issue 9: "is=
 already signed" message</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c6983903-c319-410c-9a8f-e5a432ab76ba"><strong>Cause:</strong=
> Binary has an existing signature (usually adhoc from PyInstaller).</p>
<p local-id=3D"d664cb58-dd1a-4bf1-81bf-3386ada6c922"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Remov=
e old signature first
codesign --remove-signature bzm-mcp-macos-arm64

# Then sign properly
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" --entitlements entitlements.plist ...</=
pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"0c5c14e3-fb9a-407b-8896-4108b6d92b3f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-Issue10:&quot;CannotstapleZIPfile&quot;">Issue 10: "Can=
not staple ZIP file"</h3>
<p local-id=3D"79eb44bc-f791-4aa2-947a-1b7f526489eb"><strong>Cause:</strong=
> ZIP files do not support stapling (by design).</p>
<p local-id=3D"86d4324c-978d-4cd9-95b3-1ed9d4c89688"><strong>Solution:</str=
ong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f8907dc3-218c-4885-baba-8a68e0fb2747">
<li local-id=3D"9d3f3e18-f176-449c-92d3-12791e9d6f02">
<p local-id=3D"908e3f29-4e9a-41c2-b14a-b3d9f3d85ade">This is expected behav=
ior for ZIP files</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc73ffd8-c081-4f71-84ed-31b4733192ca">
<p local-id=3D"a4ff87fb-7ad0-4525-9a0d-e5c1047a1fe6">ZIP files can still be=
 notarized, just not stapled</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26d5a393-a38a-4b2d-8048-1753e05b121b">
<p local-id=3D"54d524bd-ab08-461c-ac29-db570aa5ff47">Users will need intern=
et connection on first run to verify</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"17e81c10-c795-4dab-973a-49dea2177c2e">
<p local-id=3D"5fe8c688-a72d-4c68-aa70-78958f156b4a">If offline verificatio=
n is critical, use DMG distribution instead</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b35fc6ef-1b62-4467-b4b1-0ecd18180c95"><strong>To verify a ZI=
P is notarized (without stapling):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Check=
 notarization status
xcrun notarytool history --keychain-profile "bzm-mcp-notary"

# Extract and check binary signature
unzip bzm-mcp-macos-arm64.zip
codesign --display --verbose=3D4 bzm-mcp-macos-arm64
# Should show: Authority=3DDeveloper ID Application</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"09cfacde-ea79-48bd-9283-c3337d01707c">
<h2 local-id=3D"2065c362-eaf6-445c-a278-f9c9627fb5e3" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=8E=AFCompleteWorkflowScripts">=F0=9F=8E=AF Compl=
ete Workflow Scripts</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7dc5ab87-6472-4185-b0ab-960d7a9543f9">Once you understand al=
l the steps, use these complete scripts for future builds:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"2204e553-5ec5-4bd0-9416-ac3915cb9595" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-ZIPDistributionScript(CurrentMethod)">ZIP Distribution =
Script (Current Method)</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">#!/bin/=
bash
set -e  # Exit on any error

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# macOS Code Signing &amp; Notarization Script
# For PyInstaller Binaries - ZIP Distribution
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

# Configuration
SIGNING_IDENTITY=3D"Developer ID Application: Your Company (TEAMID)"
BINARY_ARM64=3D"bzm-mcp-macos-arm64"
BINARY_AMD64=3D"bzm-mcp-macos-amd64"
ENTITLEMENTS=3D"../entitlements.plist"
NOTARY_PROFILE=3D"bzm-mcp-notary"

cd /Users/joaquinaraujo/github/bzm-mcp/dist

echo "=F0=9F=9A=80 Starting macOS signing &amp; notarization process (ZIP).=
.."
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# ARM64 Binary
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=93=B1 Processing ARM64 binary..."

# 1. Check and remove quarantine attribute
echo "  Checking for quarantine attribute..."
if xattr -l "$BINARY_ARM64" 2&gt;/dev/null | grep -q "com.apple.quarantine"=
; then
  echo "  Removing quarantine attribute..."
  xattr -d com.apple.quarantine "$BINARY_ARM64"
fi

# 2. Remove adhoc signature
echo "  Removing adhoc signature..."
codesign --remove-signature "$BINARY_ARM64" 2&gt;/dev/null || true

# 3. Sign with entitlements
echo "  Signing binary..."
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements "$ENTITLEMENTS" \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "$BINARY_ARM64"

# 4. Verify signature
echo "  Verifying signature..."
codesign --verify --verbose "$BINARY_ARM64"
codesign --display --verbose=3D4 "$BINARY_ARM64" | grep Authority

# 5. Test binary
echo "  Testing binary..."
./"$BINARY_ARM64" --version || echo "=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F  Binary test failed=
, but continuing..."

# 6. Create ZIP
echo "  Creating ZIP..."
rm -f "${BINARY_ARM64}.zip"
ditto -c -k --sequesterRsrc --keepParent "$BINARY_ARM64" "${BINARY_ARM64}.z=
ip"

# 7. Notarize ZIP
echo "  Notarizing ZIP (this takes 1-5 minutes)..."
xcrun notarytool submit "${BINARY_ARM64}.zip" \
  --keychain-profile "$NOTARY_PROFILE" \
  --wait

# 8. Verify
echo "  Final verification..."
spctl --assess --type install "${BINARY_ARM64}.zip" || echo "=E2=9C=85 Nota=
rized (verification may require extraction)"

echo "=E2=9C=85 ARM64 binary complete!"
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# AMD64 Binary
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=92=BB Processing AMD64 binary..."

# Repeat same steps for AMD64
if xattr -l "$BINARY_AMD64" 2&gt;/dev/null | grep -q "com.apple.quarantine"=
; then
  echo "  Removing quarantine attribute..."
  xattr -d com.apple.quarantine "$BINARY_AMD64"
fi

codesign --remove-signature "$BINARY_AMD64" 2&gt;/dev/null || true

codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements "$ENTITLEMENTS" \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "$BINARY_AMD64"

codesign --verify --verbose "$BINARY_AMD64"

rm -f "${BINARY_AMD64}.zip"
ditto -c -k --sequesterRsrc --keepParent "$BINARY_AMD64" "${BINARY_AMD64}.z=
ip"

xcrun notarytool submit "${BINARY_AMD64}.zip" \
  --keychain-profile "$NOTARY_PROFILE" \
  --wait

echo "=E2=9C=85 AMD64 binary complete!"
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# Summary
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=8E=89 All done!"
echo ""
echo "Signed and notarized ZIPs:"
echo "  =E2=80=A2 ${BINARY_ARM64}.zip (Apple Silicon)"
echo "  =E2=80=A2 ${BINARY_AMD64}.zip (Intel)"
echo ""
echo "=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F  Note: ZIP files cannot be stapled. First-run veri=
fication requires internet connection."
echo "Ready to distribute!"</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"3ae7ce7d-374a-4386-bd30-b37ebb2f0bc2" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-DMGDistributionScript(AlternativeMethod)">DMG Distribut=
ion Script (Alternative Method)</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">#!/bin/=
bash
set -e  # Exit on any error

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# macOS Code Signing &amp; Notarization Script
# For PyInstaller Binaries - DMG Distribution
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

# Configuration
SIGNING_IDENTITY=3D"Developer ID Application: Your Company (TEAMID)"
BINARY_ARM64=3D"bzm-mcp-macos-arm64"
BINARY_AMD64=3D"bzm-mcp-macos-amd64"
ENTITLEMENTS=3D"../entitlements.plist"
NOTARY_PROFILE=3D"bzm-mcp-notary"

cd /Users/joaquinaraujo/github/bzm-mcp/dist

echo "=F0=9F=9A=80 Starting macOS signing &amp; notarization process (DMG).=
.."
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# ARM64 Binary
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=93=B1 Processing ARM64 binary..."

# Steps 1-5 same as ZIP script (quarantine, sign, verify, test)
if xattr -l "$BINARY_ARM64" 2&gt;/dev/null | grep -q "com.apple.quarantine"=
; then
  xattr -d com.apple.quarantine "$BINARY_ARM64"
fi

codesign --remove-signature "$BINARY_ARM64" 2&gt;/dev/null || true

codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements "$ENTITLEMENTS" \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "$BINARY_ARM64"

codesign --verify --verbose "$BINARY_ARM64"

./"$BINARY_ARM64" --version || echo "=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F  Binary test failed=
, but continuing..."

# 6. Create DMG
echo "  Creating DMG..."
rm -f "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg"
mkdir -p /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-arm64
cp "$BINARY_ARM64" /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-arm64/
hdiutil create -volname "BlazeMeter MCP" \
  -srcfolder /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-arm64 \
  -ov -format UDZO \
  "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg"
rm -rf /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-arm64

# 7. Sign DMG
echo "  Signing DMG..."
codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg"

# 8. Notarize
echo "  Notarizing DMG (this takes 1-5 minutes)..."
xcrun notarytool submit "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg" \
  --keychain-profile "$NOTARY_PROFILE" \
  --wait

# 9. Staple
echo "  Stapling notarization ticket..."
xcrun stapler staple "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg"

# 10. Verify
echo "  Final verification..."
xcrun stapler validate "${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg"
spctl --assess --type open --context context:primary-signature "${BINARY_AR=
M64}.dmg"

echo "=E2=9C=85 ARM64 binary complete!"
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# AMD64 Binary (same process)
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=92=BB Processing AMD64 binary..."

if xattr -l "$BINARY_AMD64" 2&gt;/dev/null | grep -q "com.apple.quarantine"=
; then
  xattr -d com.apple.quarantine "$BINARY_AMD64"
fi

codesign --remove-signature "$BINARY_AMD64" 2&gt;/dev/null || true

codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --entitlements "$ENTITLEMENTS" \
  --options runtime \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "$BINARY_AMD64"

codesign --verify --verbose "$BINARY_AMD64"

rm -f "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg"
mkdir -p /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64
cp "$BINARY_AMD64" /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64/
hdiutil create -volname "BlazeMeter MCP Intel" \
  -srcfolder /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64 \
  -ov -format UDZO \
  "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg"
rm -rf /tmp/bzm-mcp-dmg-amd64

codesign --sign "$SIGNING_IDENTITY" \
  --timestamp \
  --force \
  --verbose \
  "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg"

xcrun notarytool submit "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg" \
  --keychain-profile "$NOTARY_PROFILE" \
  --wait

xcrun stapler staple "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg"
xcrun stapler validate "${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg"

echo "=E2=9C=85 AMD64 binary complete!"
echo ""

# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
# Summary
# =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D
echo "=F0=9F=8E=89 All done!"
echo ""
echo "Signed and notarized DMGs:"
echo "  =E2=80=A2 ${BINARY_ARM64}.dmg (Apple Silicon)"
echo "  =E2=80=A2 ${BINARY_AMD64}.dmg (Intel)"
echo ""
echo "=E2=9C=85 DMG files are stapled for offline verification."
echo "Ready to distribute!"</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"0fbbf0e2-408f-447a-b087-64daef652b89"><strong>To use these s=
cripts:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"864271dc-8995-4128-932e-5c980e7ba47e">
<li local-id=3D"899615fd-be28-4489-b4e0-1b74f5bb745f">
<p local-id=3D"8d3154b5-a455-40e2-bdda-ffcfc1dc7122">Choose the appropriate=
 script (ZIP for current method, DMG for alternative)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14dd1108-6aa2-4b10-8027-12c5ca0adc69">
<p local-id=3D"54962506-6f0d-4310-8436-26862665b709">Save it as <code>sign-=
and-notarize-zip.sh</code> or <code>sign-and-notarize-dmg.sh</code></p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"e85033d8-74ff-42b1-98ec-3a4c646e2af2">
<p local-id=3D"1f968cd1-ace5-492e-b193-1cc4fcf1f5c7">Update the <code>SIGNI=
NG_IDENTITY</code> with your actual identity</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5982cbd9-4517-4888-9e50-819a1b4958dd">
<p local-id=3D"a631c6ab-050d-4643-ac1e-b08a7d73d106">Make it executable: <c=
ode>chmod +x sign-and-notarize-*.sh</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a9b5b46-87a2-40a9-a808-ef61332ed1c8">
<p local-id=3D"51e49442-f7ae-49a7-aad5-b5d874567dc8">Run it after building:=
 <code>./sign-and-notarize-zip.sh</code></p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"8fd00fd0-1cb4-4d5f-a83a-a74897ba54bb">
<h2 local-id=3D"8dfaa8dc-0d90-496b-b12f-96c42856c1ef" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=93=9DQuickReferenceChecklist">=F0=9F=93=9D Quick=
 Reference Checklist</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"8c3a228e-f3e8-4031-b007-a9fdfc134b1c" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=E2=8F=B0ONE-TIMESETUP(Dothesestepsonlyonce)">=E2=8F=B0=
 ONE-TIME SETUP (Do these steps only once)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"fda735ea-f44f-4aff-b360-b27bc39cd520"><strong>Security Setup=
:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f654de4c-2775-4051-a7d2-4fe838a15446">
<li local-id=3D"f8e772a0-865b-455c-825c-318cc9aab391">
<p local-id=3D"f47a6d8f-6655-48f2-b052-011a9811fbab">[ ] Install Xcode Comm=
and Line Tools: <code>xcode-select --install</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"355c766f-a4f2-4f7c-8076-44796a9f1a2d">
<p local-id=3D"9afb395c-73df-441c-9e62-58b49d78be2b">[ ] Create secure temp=
orary directory (<code>~/tmp/signing-setup</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aae44626-7e7a-42b8-8b50-371d54778b51">
<p local-id=3D"60d30c51-495e-47ce-8fe7-cf4db21b127c">[ ] Extract certificat=
es in secure location</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b90186bf-a1f0-44fe-89f8-db285f0e0d48">
<p local-id=3D"14618c5f-cf09-4909-9e9e-1bd9b945eb0c">[ ] Import Apple's roo=
t certificate to Keychain</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"79ed7009-0705-4c27-b8ff-c60916243b6e">
<p local-id=3D"cc92ce64-c9fa-462a-8a53-1977b04a9d53">[ ] Import your Develo=
per ID Application .p12 to Keychain</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d702e23-ce9c-4bd7-b5a6-9a4c0edea0c2">
<p local-id=3D"f24e5e80-80f9-415a-b0ce-b20b7b549f04">[ ] Store API key (.p8=
) in <code>~/.apple-keys/</code> with restricted permissions (chmod 600)</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"679200de-e512-43ea-82a7-143dd4ceaf54">
<p local-id=3D"f7adddf5-61d2-47c5-bed4-7f4fd1d8d38b">[ ] Delete temporary c=
ertificate files after import</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a00ed36e-9114-43c3-a015-27724eed260e">
<p local-id=3D"9d66c657-4098-49f7-9f93-f019e2b2aa30">[ ] Store notarization=
 credentials in Keychain (via <code>notarytool store-credentials</code>)</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"4889f034-0810-4d10-8f63-a5829ffbc128">
<p local-id=3D"5a2a7fa4-6036-41e0-9642-b3c185619f1d">[ ] Verify no credenti=
als left in Downloads or temp directories</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9ee95cfe-9ced-41e7-8394-c115fd91407d">
<p local-id=3D"f0a1498e-ec36-4aa8-b60a-8d4c5dc49a32">[ ] Verify signing ide=
ntity: <code>security find-identity -v -p codesigning</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ccbbbd10-3e62-47e9-b159-d25d6b846599"><strong>PyInstaller Se=
tup:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"fa0f4ce1-2246-4096-a636-8bdae8ec0051">
<li local-id=3D"6deb6ebb-a0da-4a84-8269-03e3a1a859b1">
<p local-id=3D"6bd4ba57-9613-4bbc-9766-59efa9d053ec">[ ] Create <code>entit=
lements.plist</code> file in your project root</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9092a62b-9c79-4afc-8f21-b88ff8c9912d">
<p local-id=3D"24381a81-6bbb-4386-939d-174600dbd52b">[ ] Add to version con=
trol</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"89426b91-8521-4fb5-8961-f05d60a9b721">
<p local-id=3D"88532e32-d9d2-4392-b053-1e5fb765a4f5">[ ] Verify entitlement=
s include:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"62230a73-0205-4505-ab75-e905acc5600a">
<li local-id=3D"bc9c155c-ba33-4ca7-9c70-6422bf797d7d">
<p local-id=3D"833b413c-882d-49c5-9c82-7eaebc15a40b"><code>com.apple.securi=
ty.cs.disable-library-validation</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"338c7302-44a1-467c-a7dd-89300689acb7">
<p local-id=3D"d0529e51-3c42-42c4-a1ac-eb82a2fdbcfe"><code>com.apple.securi=
ty.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"49b08775-b02f-440f-9f54-c323bb5d076b">
<p local-id=3D"83225dd1-534a-4b3e-bec8-a5431db040ef"><code>com.apple.securi=
ty.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory</code></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"8b285022-4740-45e8-a41e-ac1baf3cb252">
<h3 local-id=3D"3cb44766-e3b5-47de-b8c7-d6439a0b34c4" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=94=84EVERYBUILD(Dothesestepsforeachnewrelease)">=
=F0=9F=94=84 EVERY BUILD (Do these steps for each new release)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"32c7fad0-7d99-44d9-af7e-0636ec85e1fa"><strong>Per Architectu=
re (ARM64 &amp; AMD64):</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d9a097b0-2052-43ce-99bf-47fe7e436ecc"><strong>Common Steps (=
Both ZIP and DMG):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"76ea847e-64a5-418d-a795-e162e4dbe4c9">
<li local-id=3D"adcd248e-da8e-4090-821d-82219f8ae724">
<p local-id=3D"6531c47e-a1c3-432b-803f-4721ba4bec9d">[ ] Build your binary =
with PyInstaller</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8a2aab22-3e37-417a-a80d-c4d41a812d91">
<p local-id=3D"0cdb91bd-7b6e-46cf-a286-2f9e825b0032">[ ] Check for quaranti=
ne attribute (<code>xattr -l binary</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9a46e01-17bf-4b81-8fd6-00e18a844ae4">
<p local-id=3D"d2395ba9-7872-4d80-9926-d8ef1a76493c">[ ] Remove quarantine =
if present (<code>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine binary</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ce91e965-bc54-4bc5-99fd-d0543aa5bdc1">
<p local-id=3D"d1596cca-157c-47e8-8765-0fb5d1138edf">[ ] Remove adhoc signa=
ture from binary (<code>codesign --remove-signature</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e23dd767-a4e9-4b1f-bb63-87fcd1d57607">
<p local-id=3D"e541171d-df7a-458e-815a-4344b252c117">[ ] Sign binary WITH e=
ntitlements (<code>--entitlements entitlements.plist</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"039c0edd-c349-4174-b543-f009b7373e66">
<p local-id=3D"bad698ee-41f9-45b5-97e8-068861ed9a15">[ ] Enable hardened ru=
ntime (<code>--options runtime</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ccfbe331-f784-47e8-9307-dc812b3444cc">
<p local-id=3D"cb207528-ac5c-4cb0-b75e-7b6093ea7713">[ ] Add timestamp (<co=
de>--timestamp</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"11e0013c-cd65-4c98-b4e1-5f6244b7c49c">
<p local-id=3D"812673f3-5c3b-465b-98b0-f8fdd2d49aae">[ ] Verify signature s=
hows <code>Authority=3DDeveloper ID</code> (NOT <code>Signature=3Dadhoc</co=
de>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0dd6f866-4489-4f0e-a7eb-a0f6bd6bb4dd">
<p local-id=3D"65541831-ac59-4434-84e2-35d967416b35">[ ] Test binary locall=
y to ensure it runs (check for Team ID errors)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3baf5307-5980-4097-b4f0-51efce9630e3"><strong>For ZIP Distri=
bution (Current Method):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f72672da-c052-4afa-806b-f9bbf9c193e7">
<li local-id=3D"cbdb16af-af3f-4143-8367-d7d66ade5273">
<p local-id=3D"0eee0acb-2d1b-4964-be65-a15b30d03415">[ ] Create ZIP from si=
gned binary (<code>ditto -c -k --sequesterRsrc --keepParent</code>)</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"1173dec4-2672-4efa-828f-be6d55a45b0e">
<p local-id=3D"d6ff8c60-00bb-4832-a5b5-ac8e1265fdb9">[ ] Submit ZIP for not=
arization</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"68493079-aa1d-4595-84f4-677bad81c717">
<p local-id=3D"32020105-60b8-4530-ada1-decc8e11dcac">[ ] Wait for acceptanc=
e (1-5 minutes)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd433242-d012-443d-a1f0-447ba6e0456f">
<p local-id=3D"cdc8b241-6479-489a-89a8-828d5c89bc94">[ ] Check notarization=
 logs if rejected</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"720f3777-b693-49cc-bef4-be4255e9fb77">
<p local-id=3D"47cafc60-af3f-4334-80bb-90a63a3964de">[ ] Verify notarizatio=
n status</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d54e0c40-b969-4c30-8220-c29ebf310988">
<p local-id=3D"cda63a5d-8f8e-4019-aa8d-2f2ab4c9fb32">[ ] Test extracted bin=
ary from ZIP</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fbb3022b-b43e-4ec7-a767-e486020f3828">
<p local-id=3D"b6708baa-ce9e-41bd-8c66-bd52a8403b52">[ ] =E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F=
 Note: ZIP cannot be stapled (requires internet on first run)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eeae7bd4-6204-472d-9adf-87fb4081c5cd">
<p local-id=3D"e3b6b967-e0e9-4c5e-9cc5-c255408870ac">[ ] Test on a differen=
t Mac if possible (ultimate test)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2a61cdf-cebc-4e8d-a1fe-4dbda1d1a5fd">
<p local-id=3D"cbe07da4-2a98-467f-abb8-b0c9d17de53c">[ ] Repeat for other a=
rchitecture</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2decbc95-f953-46d0-8ecd-0c592a446bf0"><strong>For DMG Distri=
bution (Alternative Method):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5726c6d3-4cfc-4a09-bced-06d0a5385594">
<li local-id=3D"771af1a4-8767-4a81-aecf-6a8fb6fe2e0f">
<p local-id=3D"a904eb84-8755-4a5b-bce7-51e261b74f78">[ ] Create DMG from si=
gned binary</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0f6c4fc8-d939-4dc9-968e-26f617f6d7bf">
<p local-id=3D"d051f16e-80a7-41ce-96bb-98f6ed1530fe">[ ] Sign the DMG</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"2c6daa86-0009-467a-8440-36b0c9843caa">
<p local-id=3D"d19f4222-cb3a-464e-8dd5-510c7c478f9d">[ ] Submit DMG for not=
arization</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8bd44c98-9ae7-4527-906f-726e3e4d4e84">
<p local-id=3D"01d85158-64f7-4d71-b079-40e827befdb2">[ ] Wait for acceptanc=
e (1-5 minutes)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8ef65a5-722d-45ab-80eb-f5b9225dcd73">
<p local-id=3D"bf214721-8b4c-4ce0-9e74-eed54205cc77">[ ] Check notarization=
 logs if rejected</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"079a2d54-91f6-41d4-8da5-9cd0fd560313">
<p local-id=3D"4a5d3ce8-043c-4ed9-ace3-b2aa78608ced">[ ] Staple notarizatio=
n ticket to DMG (not the binary!)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"16be7534-1ec6-4606-bbe0-e0fdff822b00">
<p local-id=3D"b6762102-401c-4c0a-b21b-f30f4038d15d">[ ] Validate stapling =
worked</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b23bda0-bef8-4704-9bbb-85fefe7b7d7b">
<p local-id=3D"883741d2-9bfa-4a1e-811b-08732846ed70">[ ] Test extracted bin=
ary from DMG</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bbe51c17-8c33-4288-8450-832c7677b49e">
<p local-id=3D"03e383e2-fec0-4383-a864-857f5c21428b">[ ] Test on a differen=
t Mac if possible (ultimate test)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd4c8927-143d-466f-ba31-772034083186">
<p local-id=3D"e9da1601-0f0a-4319-9b5d-eb79d8f9c3a3">[ ] Repeat for other a=
rchitecture</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"5a68c250-ea60-4dd1-8ef4-9257e288920e">
<h2 local-id=3D"2446b34a-51da-4a9d-ace4-aa347eaa12cb" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=A4=96AutomatingwithCI/CD(SecurityConsiderations)=
">=F0=9F=A4=96 Automating with CI/CD (Security Considerations)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8ec212fc-586f-4d2b-be58-a18cabcddb38">When you're ready to a=
utomate this in your <code>build.py</code> or CI/CD pipeline:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"86bf9747-a2d3-457d-9ce1-66881d67fbf0" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-GitHubActions/GitLabCIApproach:">GitHub Actions / GitLa=
b CI Approach:</h3>
<p local-id=3D"82ec60e1-10b8-48ab-952c-60aa16c6a2a7"><strong>Store credenti=
als as encrypted secrets:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># GitHu=
b Secrets to create:
# - APPLE_CERTIFICATE_P12 (base64 encoded .p12 file)
# - APPLE_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD
# - APPLE_API_KEY_P8 (base64 encoded .p8 file)
# - APPLE_API_KEY_ID
# - APPLE_ISSUER_ID</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a7a50378-12dc-4597-b6da-4b919b594543"><strong>In your workfl=
ow:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Decod=
e and import certificate
echo "$APPLE_CERTIFICATE_P12" | base64 --decode &gt; certificate.p12
security create-keychain -p "$KEYCHAIN_PASSWORD" build.keychain
security import certificate.p12 -k build.keychain -P "$APPLE_CERTIFICATE_PA=
SSWORD"
security set-keychain-settings -lut 21600 build.keychain

# Save API key
echo "$APPLE_API_KEY_P8" | base64 --decode &gt; AuthKey.p8

# Sign and notarize...

# Clean up
security delete-keychain build.keychain
rm -f certificate.p12 AuthKey.p8</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"1841c8bc-d385-42af-ad34-ec64de449a6f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-BestPracticesforCI/CD:">Best Practices for CI/CD:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b5c67142-19bf-4330-9b77-06a5859f1687">
<li local-id=3D"9533a125-a6ed-4398-ad53-4def082ac6e4">
<p local-id=3D"297a0892-93e7-4878-9c3b-6a66451aec86">=E2=9C=85 Use encrypte=
d secrets/variables</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a5c23de-955e-4c43-919f-c749314e5939">
<p local-id=3D"b00e04f7-008a-402b-82da-3c683b007d4f">=E2=9C=85 Create tempo=
rary keychains (delete after build)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"848e116a-63fd-4176-93aa-e04e5771e5a2">
<p local-id=3D"3b602371-0459-4c39-adb2-b9693e1d4c0f">=E2=9C=85 Clean up cre=
dentials at end of pipeline</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b8d44b0-4219-4806-8605-809cacb48bf0">
<p local-id=3D"ba2035cf-8fca-4c3d-a6fd-3429c956d430">=E2=9C=85 Use short-li=
ved tokens when possible</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a221b2b-ce12-4693-a007-d3927d718c3f">
<p local-id=3D"77d5c8ed-c079-4511-a422-03e88478d68d">=E2=9C=85 Restrict who=
 can view/edit secrets</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5c4ba9d-9263-4c03-b06f-651bda87c737">
<p local-id=3D"04c3bb7b-0a06-46c7-ad13-5d8e5e7bc6f3">=E2=9C=85 Use dedicate=
d Apple Developer account for CI</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ad6e488-8be4-41a9-8f90-42c9606c1484">
<p local-id=3D"94f325ca-eb40-4b90-8ab6-0fc3a8660968">=E2=9D=8C Never log cr=
edentials or print them</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c4348ed-b9aa-451a-b267-92d9952bbc43">
<p local-id=3D"471bd54f-7633-4701-aee1-1b474dbd3956">=E2=9D=8C Never commit=
 credentials to repo</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a5cc341c-b69d-4738-94a2-b5ea1137c3fb">
<p local-id=3D"a0cf0ce3-ab23-4d7c-91f3-59f1717fb65a">=E2=9D=8C Don't use pe=
rsonal certificates for CI</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"69beb62b-30c0-45aa-9eea-365c2d6010dd">
<h2 local-id=3D"c1fcfd82-de24-4ec0-b074-a6bc4cc53fe9" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=94=97AdditionalResources">=F0=9F=94=97 Additiona=
l Resources</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"adb3c832-d04d-4e42-a1c2-87a51b5d9ee2">
<li local-id=3D"633a4d0e-4888-46b4-b6da-ba4c9d6ccef7">
<p local-id=3D"6dbca5aa-84ad-49c9-8806-753c12c73646"><a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/Secu=
rity/Conceptual/CodeSigningGuide/" rel=3D"nofollow">Apple's Code Signing Gu=
ide</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6d6b3439-15c6-4d0e-bc71-1e2d54a46b16">
<p local-id=3D"f84eecae-585c-4d36-9915-44341a339c22"><a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing_=
macos_software_before_distribution" rel=3D"nofollow">Notarizing macOS Softw=
are</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1fd58589-5e24-4276-b869-581fa07ee2b9">
<p local-id=3D"69449f55-0251-46cb-a3cf-0f82466469e1"><a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/technotes/tn3147-how=
-to-notarize-macos-software" rel=3D"nofollow">TN3147: How to notarize</a></=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e25bf51-1d92-4d5c-9628-71164b4bfef9">
<p local-id=3D"b67e7dba-8112-4b33-a584-6e2eeff7dcac"><a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/encrypted-s=
ecrets" rel=3D"nofollow">GitHub Actions: Encrypted Secrets</a></p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"441b7ce5-772c-4453-8c58-120be23bf106">
<h2 local-id=3D"7f2419d8-7a68-406e-9197-1da71d3c6f9f" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=92=A1NextSteps">=F0=9F=92=A1 Next Steps</h2>
<p local-id=3D"658eb336-b61b-4b13-8f07-69aca855142e">Once you've done this =
manually and understand the process, you can:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1a7e3e57-4bab-4bfb-b7c7-b9a239e25ff4">
<li local-id=3D"c6ece2a8-68f5-4ef9-af2e-ef1ed85332fb">
<p local-id=3D"fc39abf0-6734-40b3-9adc-36f3e7ca5446">Automate it in your <c=
ode>build.py</code> script</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b828621d-c7fc-44d3-b778-a6dca63305dd">
<p local-id=3D"71ce345d-43c6-4d4d-80f8-91413099d486">Add it to your CI/CD p=
ipeline</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5266623c-b4c3-43fe-a029-e4e580150905">
<p local-id=3D"f645f975-d326-4c63-88c2-d305448c3a00">Choose your preferred =
distribution method (ZIP for simplicity, DMG for polish)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"76eaca8e-c12e-4fe5-a912-2dadfd9ba97b">
<p local-id=3D"ac9411e1-1ec7-4ae6-a7c8-ce7e9cca62da">Learn about Windows co=
de signing (uses <code>signtool.exe</code> with a similar process)</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"9f6e6d3f-d4ae-498a-b93f-7b546cbd3f4c">
<h2 local-id=3D"20189415-fc47-4aa8-896c-1b8651b69d11" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-QuestionstoVerifyYourSetup">Questions to Verify Your Se=
tup</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f97b75cf-f746-418a-b1d6-7a6df003c998">Before you start, make=
 sure you can answer:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"9ee09f93-3ca6-4163-85c8-60b9c6b0882c">
<li local-id=3D"5f77ec91-17a7-4f32-8e06-1ab94839b1b3">
<p local-id=3D"d7ec4310-44c0-4de8-96c6-84a18af25da6"><strong>Where is your =
</strong><code>.p8</code> API key file located? (Should be in <code>~/.appl=
e-keys/</code> after setup)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec522d5e-4fd1-4d7d-8316-bd6d7bb77771">
<p local-id=3D"945c2d66-2600-4e93-bbac-7a60db03dc91"><strong>What's the Key=
 ID</strong> (the XXXXXXXXXX in AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8)?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f71637c4-bb00-46ce-9a40-ce53f9ae0d7b">
<p local-id=3D"42c6e534-0a0c-4962-93b4-e58e08500402"><strong>Do you have th=
e certificate as </strong><code>.p12</code> or <code>.cer</code>? (If .cer,=
 you might also need the private key)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"50f47b65-fc17-48d2-aa4d-fa49739985c1">
<p local-id=3D"90fbcb60-29a3-4455-b93f-8ae4530f4b6c"><strong>Have you enrol=
led in the Apple Developer Program?</strong> (Required for Developer ID cer=
tificates)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8f48e59f-cf2e-4cf2-9e59-f467e9c025eb">
<p local-id=3D"a6a56630-8853-478c-b7ab-38b16f793420"><strong>Have you secur=
ed your credentials properly?</strong> (Keychain for certs, restricted perm=
issions for .p8)</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"34dd363c-8033-489b-a81e-5282ff65f12f">
<h2 local-id=3D"6ac9243a-3893-47f4-a635-ac39bc2c5c22" id=3D"MCPMacOsSigning=
-Notarization-Stamp-=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8FSecurityChecklistforGitRepository"=
>=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F Security Checklist for Git Repository</h2>
<p local-id=3D"178258c8-9d5e-415b-97cc-30cc305ed1a4"><strong>Add these to y=
our </strong><code>.gitignore</code> to prevent credential leaks:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Apple=
 Code Signing Credentials
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
certificates/
certificates.zip
AuthKey_*.p8

# Keychain exports
*.keychain
*.keychain-db

# Distribution packages (these are build artifacts, not source)
*.dmg
*.zip</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f2149459-0ea4-4ed8-9fd2-2b7d98e1dda1"><strong>IMPORTANT:</st=
rong> If you ever accidentally commit credentials:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f4319683-d55c-4970-9157-a2dd115e3ee4">
<li local-id=3D"e5af0584-77b1-4e80-9328-b389f1a6c1f5">
<p local-id=3D"988e56de-41f2-4dc6-9b00-84844b7792c2">Immediately revoke the=
m in Apple Developer Portal</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7cafabfd-a0a0-4e47-a6bb-d2ab7e284056">
<p local-id=3D"5bf67a8a-8902-45ce-a4d9-9bc47ecf0d78">Generate new credentia=
ls</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"870230d3-c9e3-4fd2-b41e-366c52a1221d">
<p local-id=3D"cbc13844-c6df-42a5-9166-7169ed6c1df8">Use <code>git filter-b=
ranch</code> or BFG Repo-Cleaner to remove from history</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4334deaa-3f15-4073-acd0-a94f2e472dbb">
<p local-id=3D"9feda4e1-3864-4a59-aa2d-f22506ca72b3">Force push (if safe to=
 do so)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"218fb61c-1114-4a5a-a245-3de118e02413">
<p local-id=3D"44003bd2-e010-49cc-89ca-dae9b47f5883">Treat the old credenti=
als as compromised permanently</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"ee3a62a9-7833-41d8-ae00-2c53f09c4116">
<p local-id=3D"98633425-3091-495b-8da1-da7aef57070c">Good luck! Once you've=
 gone through this process manually, you'll understand exactly what's happe=
ning and can confidently automate it. Feel free to ask questions as you wor=
k through each step! =F0=9F=9A=80</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
